# This is a fully static, client-side site — it requires NO environment
# variables or secrets to build, run, or deploy.
#
# Do not add API keys here or anywhere that reaches the client bundle:
# anything referenced in src/ or injected via Vite `define` ships publicly.
# If a backend is ever added, keep secrets server-side only (e.g. Vercel
# Environment Variables) and never expose them to the browser.
